      "cooked": "<p>How do I adjust the currency in Frappe CRM? After installing it, I haven’t made any settings in Frappe CRM, but why did it switch to INR? I’m using IDR (Indonesian Rupiah). Can anyone tell me how to change it? What should I do?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/b/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/b/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9_2_690x342.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"d7rNA4qI6GZqtkIw60Up2fjLneN\" width=\"690\" height=\"342\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/b/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9_2_690x342.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/b/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9_2_1035x513.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/b/5bf3ce174c1edb6822fdf551a2b99b9dfd11afc9_2_1380x684.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"DBDBDB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×953 109 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
