      "created_at": "2026-02-17T15:34:32.581Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi!</p>\n<p>The solution is uninstall crm app and install again.</p>\n<p>I got the same situation when I installed erpnext and crm applications at the same time. When you install erpnext first, login and setup company, and then install app crm currency is ok, it takes currency from your company.</p>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
